OHOS: keep the scrolled application and its controls visible during capture.
Hide the opaque full-screen overlay, use the visible stitched preview as the
scrolling toolbar's owner, and present the toolbar for previewShown. A dedicated
scrolling-presentation flag allows show requests before the palette changes mode
and cancels them on exit. Add SNOW_OHOS_TOOLBAR_BEFORE/AFTER and
SNOW_OHOS_PREVIEW_SHOWN diagnostics to compare widget and native visibility.

